  "stressTestVerdictPanicDescription": "You let fear dictate your actions, selling assets at the worst possible moment and locking in losses. The data shows you sold at the bottom at least twice while the market was in decline. Emotional discipline is the cornerstone of successful investing. Consider setting stop-loss limits and sticking to a predefined strategy rather than reacting to short-term market noise.",
